# armour/shared/pauldron_cop5_l: the great COP pauldron on the left shoulder (cop.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a round cast disc grown great: one big dome lit at its top-left with a two-pixel glint, a dark crease and the
# rolled rim's lit lip under it; round at the top and the bottom (FOUNDRY, bronze; the ROUND mass).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the rolled rim, G the dome's glint, N the crease, P the dome's lit face.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron cop.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
